  "description": "The traffic\u2011control configuration is recorded under version\u202f1.0.3 and applies to two signal systems. System\u202f1 operates with an adaptive plan set to **PLAN** (plan\u202f101, mode\u202fFREE, pattern\u202f5) while its time\u2011of\u2011day (TOD) mode is **STANDBY** (plan\u202f102, mode\u202fFLASH, pattern\u202f3) and the override is forced to a **PATTERN** (plan\u202f103, mode\u202fFREE, pattern\u202f2). At the moment the controller reports the active state as **PLAN**, executing a **TRANSITION** operation with a target interval of 30\u202fseconds; the failure status is **UNKNOWN**. The current plan for system\u202f1 is identified as **CP\u201101** with a cycle length of 120\u202fseconds, a minimum green of 30\u202fseconds, an offset of\u202f5\u202fseconds and signal\u2011plan identifier\u202f1. This plan defines two phases: Phase\u202fA shows a **Green** indication serving movement\u202f1, has a \u201crof\u201d flag\u202f1, no split, displays **EW_G**, with a minimum variable time of\u202f5\u202fseconds, a variable extension of\u202f10\u202fseconds, clear\u202f0 and fixed\u202f1; Phase\u202fB shows a **Yellow** indication serving movement\u202f2, \u201crof\u201d\u202f0, no split, displays **EW_W**, with a minimum variable of\u202f2\u202fseconds, no variable extension, clear\u202f1 and fixed\u202f0.\n\nSystem\u202f2 uses an adaptive mode of **PATTERN** (plan\u202f201, mode\u202fFLASH, pattern\u202f7) and its TOD setting is **PLAN** (plan\u202f202, mode\u202fFREE, pattern\u202f4). The override for this system is set to **STANDBY** (plan\u202f203, mode\u202fFLASH, pattern\u202f1). Currently the controller reports a **FLASH** state, performing a **PICKUP** operation with a target interval of 45\u202fseconds, and the failure condition is logged as **RESET**. The active plan, labeled **CP\u201102**, runs a 90\u2011second cycle, a minimum of\u202f25\u202fseconds, an offset of\u202f3\u202fseconds and signal\u2011plan identifier\u202f2. This plan contains a single phase, Phase\u202fC, which displays **Red**, serves movement\u202f3, has \u201crof\u201d\u202f0, no split, displays **NS_L**, and carries zero minimum\u2011variable and variable times, with clear\u202f1 and fixed\u202f1.",
